  "title": "Qt: PreferencesDialog doesn't need to signal InterfaceListManager twice",
  "description": "The PreferencesDialog already sends a PreferencesChanged signal, which\nthe InterfaceListManager listens to and refreshes if the extcap no\ncapture preference has changed. The dialog doesn't need to repeat that\nlogic and send the message a second time.\n\nPing #21318",
